      "changes": [
        "Derive the auxiliary arithmetic-mean inequality from positive weighted trace of the actual exponential difference square. The positive semidefinite weight is unnormalized and need not commute with the two commuting Hermitian generators; every real exponent and empty coordinate sets are included. This is distinct from the printed Cauchy\u2013Schwarz geometric-mean estimate in Section7 lines553\u2013555."
